# Curious Inquiry: only combat damage dealt to a PLAYER investigates. Bot1's enchanted Ornithopter (1/3 flying) is blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter
# on turn 3 and damages the creature (0/2 -> 1 damage), not the player: no Clue, Bot2 stays at 20.

